	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S. D.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Ludo adhuc in meis laboribus; ideo sum <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>brevior.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Valemus hic satis bene per dei gratiam; <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>utinam vos quoque recte valeatis.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Literae tuae <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>bona fide mihi sunt redditae.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Pro diligentia illa <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>tua gratias ago.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Nihil in praesenti habeo te dignum.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z6"/>Tuo arbitrio permitto, <persName>Augustinum</persName> accipias an non <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>accipias.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="de"><foreign xml:lang="la">Arbitror d. d. <persName ref="p1283">Gessnerum</persName> subinde ab amicis <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>donari codicibus, et lex nostra inter alia habet,</foreign> das <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>ein guͦter herr oder fründ, wie von allter har kummen, <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>und uß sinem eignen guͦt von nemmen <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>möge schencke one gfhaar.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Ego tamen nihil unquam, <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>quod alicuius esset momenti, accipere volui a regum <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>legatis.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Dedi libros aliquot <persName ref="p629">Cognetio</persName>; ille Theophylactum <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>in 4 evangelia ad me misit; ego vero alios ipsi iterum <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>misi, ut rependerem etc.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Vix credere <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>possum <persName ref="p18575">Philippum Hispanum</persName> permissurum, ut pro sua vo<lb xml:id="p1z17"/>luntate <placeName ref="l306">Mediolano</placeName> utatur pontifex.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Non bene con<lb xml:id="p1z18"/>venit <persName ref="p18477">Ferdinando</persName> et <persName ref="p18575">Philippo</persName> propter <placeName ref="l306">Mediolanum</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Fortass<lb xml:id="p1z19"/>is iubebunt hunc papam cardinales mori.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="de">Ich <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>hab üch vorlangist das ellend roß todt und läbendig, <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>gsotten und braten übergäben; lösend, was <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>ir mögend, ich wil sy hie nüt; die rappen <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>trügendts ettwan uff dem wäg hinwäg.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="de">Was <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>ir lösend, ist gwün; dann ich nun imerdar <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>sorg, ich müsse über allen kosten erst ouch <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>den schinderlhon darzuͦ geben.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="de">Dorumb ver<lb xml:id="p1z27"/>kouffents, wie ir mögend und alls ob es üwer <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>wer.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="de">Min sun <persName ref="p475">Stoffel</persName> hat allwäg vil <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>uff rossen und ryten gehept; deß ahtt in <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>gott uff ein sömlichen ellenden balmesel ge<lb xml:id="p1z31"/>setzt, ob er wöllte witzig werden, were ein <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>guͦts rößly.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la">Sed extra iocum; vobis omnem <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>potestatem do vendendi etc.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la">Ego me vobis gratum <lb xml:id="p1z34"/>semper exhibebo.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la">Fabro precium persolvite; <lb xml:id="p1z35"/>omnia bona fide reddam.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Vale et saluta <lb xml:id="p1z36"/>d. <persName>Philippum</persName>, <persName ref="p6130">Pontasellam</persName>, d. d. consules, d. legatum, <lb xml:id="p1z37"/>amicos omnes.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l587">Tiguri</placeName> 23. februarii 1560.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z38"/><persName ref="p495">Bullingerus</persName> vester.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Praestantissimo viro d. <lb xml:id="p2z2"/><persName ref="p8009">Ioanni Fabritio</persName>, <placeName ref="l98">Curiensis</placeName> <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>ecclesiae fideli <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>ministro, domino et <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>fratri suo colendissimo <lb xml:id="p2z6"/>et charissimo.</s>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z7"/><placeName ref="l98">Chur</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
